usage: refresh_identity.py [-h] [--mirrorecma MIRRORECMA]
                           [--mirrorgate MIRRORGATE]
                           [--framework-catalog-bin FRAMEWORK_CATALOG_BIN]
                           [--catalog CATALOG] [--locks-root LOCKS_ROOT]
                           [--skip-component-records] [--skip-render]
                           [--skip-mirrorecma-record-write]

Refresh the acyclic private C4 catalog and I2 lock identities.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --mirrorecma MIRRORECMA
  --mirrorgate MIRRORGATE
  --framework-catalog-bin FRAMEWORK_CATALOG_BIN
  --catalog CATALOG     catalog to refresh; defaults to the checked Ubuntu
                        24.04 catalog
  --locks-root LOCKS_ROOT
                        lock root to refresh; defaults to the checked Ubuntu
                        24.04 root
  --skip-component-records
                        variant snapshots only: do not rewrite component-owned
                        catalog records
  --skip-render         variant snapshots only: skip compact/markdown
                        projection generation
  --skip-mirrorecma-record-write
                        development snapshots only: leave the component-owned
                        derived record unchanged
